{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>When I go out of the city.</b> Even though you said <b>and there is yet much thundering of Elohim and hail</b>, all this will not cease until I go out of the city." "<b>The thunders will cease and the hail will be no more, to the end that you may know that to YHWH belongs the earth.</b> All this will happen together in a single instant, contrary to the way of nature. And this is so that you may know — not because I think you have already returned in repentance, for in truth you have not."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:24:57.242727794Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}